From: Edwin Moquete <edwinmmoquete@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2020 13:13:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 067/178] arm64: dts: xiaomi: Disable vbmeta on unsupported
 devices

Change-Id: I0db01d6f071faee4f6048ea4eeb5de0dff814067
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/qcom/xiaomi/jasmine.dtsi              | 1 +
 .../vendor/qcom/xiaomi/longcheer/common/longcheer-sdm636.dtsi    | 1 +
 .../arm64/boot/dts/vendor/qcom/xiaomi/mi/jason/jason-sdm660.dtsi | 1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/qcom/xiaomi/wayne.dtsi                | 1 +
